===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈspɛktɹəɫ/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-spectral.wav|Audio (Southern England)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Of, or pertaining to, [[spectre]]s; [[ghostly]].
#: {{syn|en|ghostly}}
#: {{ant|en|nonspectral}}
#: {{ux|en|The '''spectral''' chain-rattling and moans gave me the chills.}}
#* {{RQ:Landon Ethel Churchill|page=202|volume=I|passage=The day itself was miserably dull; a thick fog shut out the landscape, while a few of the nearer trees alone were visible, spreading out their thin '''spectral''' arms on the murky air.}}
#* {{RQ:Dickens Haunted House|page=27|column=2|chapter=The Ghost in Master B's Room|passage=Agitated by a multitude of curious thoughts, I retired to my room, that night, prepared to encounter some new experience of a '''spectral''' character.}}
# Of, or pertaining to, [[spectrum|spectra]]; classified according to [[frequency]] or [[wavelength]] (of light etc)

